%% Left-to-right service map: parallel edges between the same pair, cylinders,
%% long labels and every line style.
%% want: API gateway
%% want: Postgres
%% want: publish
flowchart LR
    Client([Mobile client]) --> GW[API gateway]
    GW --> Auth[Auth service]
    GW --> Orders[Order service]
    GW --> Search[Search service]

    Auth --> Users[(Users DB)]
    Orders --> PG[(Postgres)]
    Orders -->|publish| Bus{{Event bus}}
    Orders -->|read model| Cache[(Redis cache)]
    Bus ==> Ship[Shipping worker]
    Bus ==> Mail[Email worker]
    Bus ==> Search

    Ship --> PG
    Ship -.->|retry with backoff| Bus
    Search --> Index[(Search index)]
    Cache -.-> PG

    Mail --x Dead[Dead letter queue]
    Dead --o Ops[On-call rotation]
